    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="7.3">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIIEg">III Eg</ref> 7.3</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ gesece se æbæra þeof þæt þæt he gesece, oððe se þe on hlafordsearwe gemet sy, þæt hi næfre feorh ne gesecan, buton se cyningc him feorhgeneres unne.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And the proved thief, or he who has been discovered in treason against his lord, whatever refuge he seeks, shall never be able to save his life, unless the king grant that it be spared.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ geséce se æbæra ðeof ðæt þæt he gesece, oþþe se ðe on hlafordsearwe gemet sie, þæt hi næfre feorh ne gesecen.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
